flowchart LR
    subgraph InterviewGraph[Interview graph schedules nodes; agents do not message directly]
        IState[(Interview graph state)]
        Q[Question agent] -->|questions output| IState
        IState -->|question, answer, difficulty| F[Feedback agent]
        F -->|feedback output| IState
        IState -->|role, type, questions when completed| S[Summary agent]
        S -->|report output| IState
    end
    subgraph RoadmapGraph[Roadmap graph passes state sequentially]
        RState[(Roadmap graph state)]
        R[Roadmap agent] -->|roadmap| RState
        RState -->|roadmap modules| Resource[Resource agent]
        Resource -->|enriched modules| RState
    end
    ResumeController[Resume controller] -->|extracted PDF text| ResumeAgent[Resume analysis agent]
    ResumeAgent -->|analysis object| ResumeController
    Model[ChatGroq]
    Q --> Model
    F --> Model
    S --> Model
    R --> Model
    Resource --> Model
    ResumeAgent --> Model
    Resource --> YouTube[YouTube API helper]
